---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
import { appointmentUrl } from '../data/site';
import { homepageServices } from '../data/services';
import {
  organizationSchema,
  websiteSchema,
  pageSchema,
} from '../lib/schema';
---

<Layout
  title="Evergreen Counseling Collective | Therapy in Fort Collins, Colorado"
  description="Individual counseling in Fort Collins, Colorado for adults navigating anxiety, burnout, relationship patterns, grief, major transitions, and difficult life experiences."
  schema={pageSchema([organizationSchema(), websiteSchema()])}
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <p class="eyebrow">
          Evergreen Counseling Collective · Fort Collins, Colorado
        </p>

        <h1>
          Compassionate support for the parts of life that feel difficult to
          carry alone.
        </h1>

        <p class="hero-copy">
          Individual counseling for adults navigating painful experiences,
          difficult emotions, relationship concerns, stress, loss, or periods
          of change.
        </p>
      </div>

      <picture class="hero-portrait">
        <source
          srcset="/images/maya/evergreen-art-360.webp 360w, /images/maya/evergreen-art-480.webp 480w, /images/maya/evergreen-art-700.webp 700w"
          sizes="(min-width: 48rem) 22rem, 12.5rem"
        />
        <img
          src="/images/maya/evergreen-art-480.webp"
          width="700"
          height="780"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
          decoding="async"
          alt="Evergreen Counseling Collective"
        />
      </picture>

      <div class="hero-actions">
        <Button href={appointmentUrl} tracking="request-appointment">
          Request an appointment
        </Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section hp-intro">
    <div class="container grid grid--2 intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">A place to begin</p>

      <div>
        <h2>Start with what feels most important right now.</h2>

        <p>
          You may know exactly what you want help with, or you may only know
          that something has become difficult to manage on your own. Therapy
          can give you time to understand what is happening and decide what
          you want to change.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tint hp-services">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Areas of support</p>
      <h2 class="measure">
        People come to counseling for many different reasons.
      </h2>

      <div class="grid grid--3 top-space">
        {
          homepageServices.map((service) =>
            service.published ? (
              <a
                class="card service-link"
                href={service.href}
                aria-label={`Learn more about ${service.title}`}
                data-track={`service-${service.slug}`}
              >
                <h3>{service.title}</h3>
                <p>{service.homeDescription}</p>
              </a>
            ) : (
              <article class="card">
                <h3>{service.title}</h3>
                <p>{service.homeDescription}</p>
              </article>
            )
          )
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section hp-approach">
    <div class="container grid grid--2">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">How therapy may take shape</p>
        <h2>Different concerns may call for different ways of working.</h2>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p>
          Maya draws from several therapeutic approaches rather than expecting
          every client to work in the same way. The methods used in counseling
          can change depending on what you are working on and what feels
          helpful.
        </p>

        <p>
          You do not need to choose a therapy approach before you begin.
          Learning about them can simply help you understand some of the tools
          Maya may use.
        </p>

        <div class="hp-approach-links">
          <a
            class="link-arrow"
            href="/about/maya-bennett/"
            data-track="service-selection"
          >
            Learn more about Lisa
          </a>

          <a class="link-arrow" href="/approaches/">
            Explore therapy approaches
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section about-band">
    <div class="container about-band-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Meet Evergreen Counseling Collective</p>

      <h2 class="measure">
        A counselor who values attention, honesty, and a genuine connection.
      </h2>

      <p class="measure">
        Maya is a Licensed Clinical Professional Counselor and EMDRIA
        Certified Therapist. She works with adults in individual counseling
        and brings clinical training together with more than 20 years of
        experience teaching yoga and meditation.
      </p>

      <a class="link-arrow" href="/about/maya-bennett/">
        Get to know Lisa
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section hp-steps">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Getting started</p>
      <h2>Clear next steps, without pressure.</h2>

      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <span>01</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Reach out</h3>
            <p>Request an appointment or contact the practice with a question.</p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li>
          <span>02</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Consider fit</h3>
            <p>
              Determine whether Bright Hope Therapy may be a good match for
              what you are looking for.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li>
          <span>03</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Complete information</h3>
            <p>
              Provide required information through the appropriate secure
              system.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li>
          <span>04</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Begin counseling</h3>
            <p>
              Meet with Maya and begin with the concerns that matter most to
              you.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tint hp-location">
    <div class="container grid grid--2">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Fort Collins, Colorado</p>
        <h2>Counseling in Northern Colorado.</h2>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p>
          Bright Hope Therapy is based in Meridian and serves people from
          Boise, Eagle, Nampa, Kuna, Star, and nearby Treasure Valley
          communities.
        </p>

        <a class="link-arrow" href="/contact/">
          Contact and getting started
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--dark">
    <div class="container final">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">A next step</p>
        <h2>See whether Evergreen may be a good fit.</h2>
      </div>

      <Button
        href={appointmentUrl}
        variant="light"
        tracking="request-appointment"
      >
        Request an appointment
      </Button>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero{
    overflow:hidden;
    padding:3.5rem 0;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--cream),#edf1ec)
  }

  .hero-grid{
    display:grid;
    gap:1.5rem;
    align-items:center
  }

  .hero-copy{
    max-width:39rem;
    margin-bottom:1.35rem;
    font-size:var(--lg);
    line-height:1.55
  }

  .hero-portrait{
    display:block;
    width:min(52vw,12.5rem);
    aspect-ratio:35/39;
    overflow:hidden;
    justify-self:center;
    border-radius:50% 50% 1rem 1rem;
    background:#b9c9c0;
    box-shadow:var(--shadow)
  }

  .hero-portrait img{
    width:100%;
    height:100%;
    object-fit:cover;
    object-position:center top
  }

  .intro>.eyebrow{
    padding-top:.2rem
  }

  .top-space{
    margin-top:1.5rem
  }

  .section-heading,
  .final{
    display:flex;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    align-items:end;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:1.15rem;
    margin-bottom:1.5rem
  }

  .about-band{
    background:#e6ece7
  }

  .about-band-inner{
    max-width:40rem;
    margin-inline:auto;
    text-align:center
  }

  .about-band-inner .link-arrow{
    display:inline-block
  }

  .hp-approach-links{
    display:grid;
    gap:.5rem;
    margin-top:1rem
  }

  .steps{
    display:grid;
    gap:.5rem;
    margin:1.5rem 0 0;
    padding:0;
    list-style:none
  }

  .steps li{
    display:flex;
    gap:1rem;
    padding:1.25rem 0;
    border-top:1px solid var(--sand)
  }

  .steps span{
    color:var(--clay-text);
    font-size:.8rem;
    font-weight:800
  }

  .steps h3{
    margin-bottom:.35rem
  }

  .final{
    margin-bottom:0
  }

  .final h2{
    max-width:20ch
  }

  @media(min-width:48rem){
    .hero{
      padding:clamp(3.5rem,8vw,6.5rem) 0
    }

    .hero-grid{
      grid-template-columns:1.25fr .75fr;
      grid-template-areas:
        "content portrait"
        "actions portrait";
      column-gap:3rem;
      row-gap:1.5rem
    }

    .hero-copy{
      margin-bottom:1.5rem;
      line-height:inherit
    }

    .hero-content{
      grid-area:content
    }

    .hero-actions{
      grid-area:actions
    }

    .hero-portrait{
      grid-area:portrait;
      width:min(100%,22rem);
      justify-self:end
    }

    .intro>.eyebrow{
      padding-top:.4rem
    }

    .top-space{
      margin-top:2rem
    }

    .section-heading,
    .final{
      gap:1.5rem;
      margin-bottom:2rem
    }

    .steps{
      grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
      gap:1rem;
      margin-top:2rem
    }

    .steps li{
      display:block;
      padding:1.5rem 0
    }

    .steps span{
      display:block;
      margin-bottom:1.2rem
    }

    .hp-intro{
      padding-block:4rem
    }

    .hp-intro .container{
      grid-template-columns:1fr;
      justify-items:center;
      text-align:center;
      max-width:30rem;
      margin-inline:auto
    }

    .hp-services{
      padding-block:5rem
    }

    .hp-approach{
      padding-block:4.25rem
    }

    .hp-approach .container{
      grid-template-columns:1fr;
      justify-items:center;
      text-align:center;
      max-width:38rem;
      margin-inline:auto
    }

    .about-band{
      padding-block:4.25rem
    }

    .hp-steps{
      padding-block:5rem
    }

    .hp-location{
      padding-block:4.5rem
    }
  }
</style>
